  "goodToKnow": "Die Kandidatur is a candidacy: seine Kandidatur erklären (to declare), die Kandidatur zurückziehen (to withdraw). Kandidieren means to stand or run for office: für den Bundestag kandidieren. In German elections, each major party names a Kanzlerkandidat, though voters elect the Bundestag, which then elects the chancellor. Stressed on the last syllable: kan-di-da-TOOR. Plural: die Kandidaturen."
